    "method": "customerAnalytics.accountsCustomPropertyValuesList",
    "toolName": "accounts-custom-property-values-list",
    "operationId": "accounts_custom_property_values_list",
    "title": "List account custom property values",
    "category": "Customer analytics",
    "description": "List the current custom property values for a single Customer Analytics account. Each result pairs a custom property definition (via `definition_id`) with the account's `value` for it — typed per the definition's display_type (string, number, boolean, or ISO-8601 datetime) — plus `created_at` and who set it. Only current values are returned; superseded history is not. Resolve a `definition_id` to its name and type with `custom-property-definitions-list` or `custom-property-definitions-retrieve`.",
